<title>USA: Greenspan concludes testimony to House panel.</title>
<headline>Greenspan concludes testimony to House panel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Federal Reserve Board Chairman Alan Greenspan on Wednesday concluded his testimony before a House Banking subcommittee. It was the second leg of his semi-annual Humphrey-Hawkins testimony. He testified before a Senate committee last week.</p>
